2. Case analysis on tableCustomName

  1. Case (% matches pattern `APPLY`)

    1. Return "apply"

  2. Case (% matches pattern `STATE`)

    1. Return "state"

  3. Case (% matches pattern `TYPE`)

    1. Return "type"

