        1. Case (% matches pattern `TRUE`)

          1. Result in : % % % |- % ==> STO' ((b true) as value)

        2. Case (% matches pattern `FALSE`)

          1. Result in : % % % |- % ==> STO' ((b false) as value)

  2. Case (% has type numberLiteral)

    1. (Let numberLiteral be (expressionIR as numberLiteral))

    2. Group literalExpressionIR-number: p IC STO |- ((numberLiteral as expressionIR) # _expressionNoteIR) ==> % %

