  2. Case (% has type instantiationIR)

    1. (Let (annotationList typeIR prefixedNameIR < typeArgumentListIR >( argumentListIR ) nameIR objectInitializerOptIR ;) be (declarationIR as instantiationIR))

    2. Group instantiationIR: cursor IC_0 STO_0 |- ((annotationList typeIR prefixedNameIR < typeArgumentListIR >( argumentListIR ) nameIR objectInitializerOptIR ;) as declarationIR) ==> % % %

